      "value": "I had mistakenly submitted it as a Feature Request, so I resubmitted it under Bug Reports.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/vrcplayerapisetavataraudiofarradius-does-not-restore-avatar-audio-if-playback-st",
